        "line": 66,
        "text": "theorem inverse_contDiffOn {n : ℕ} {U : Set E}\n    (M : E → Matrix (Fin n) (Fin n) ℝ)\n    (hM : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ M U) (hdet : ∀ p ∈ U, (M p).det ≠ 0) :\n    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun p => (M p)⁻¹) U"
